    "modified": "This page was last modified 14:48, September 16, 2026 (Update 81.3) [editor metadata omitted; see source history].",
    "permanent": "https://ddowiki.com/index.php?title=Item:The_Skull_of_the_Horned_King&oldid=714102",
    "text": "The Skull of the Horned King\nMinimum level\t35\t\nItem Type\tClothing / Helm\nSlot\tHead\nRace Absolutely Required\tNone\nBinding\tBound to Character on Acquire\nDurability\t450\nMaterial\tFlesh\nHardness\t55\nBase Value\t14,001pp \nWeight\t0.10 lbs\nLocation\tTerror of the Demon Lords, end chest\nEnchantments\t\nRelentless Fury\nArmor-Piercing 25%\nDoublestrike 18%\nEnhanced Bloodrage\nNearly Complete: Ability Score\nThis item can be upgraded with one of the following:\nCharisma +16\nConstitution +16\nDexterity +16\nIntelligence +16\nStrength +16\nWisdom +16\nGreen Augment Slot\nYellow Augment Slot\nSun Augment Slot\nMythic Head Boost +1 or +3\n\t\nUpgradeable?\t\nDescription\tThe skull of Baphomet, taken as his form faded away. He may regenerate in the Abyss, but this will be a lasting reminder of his defeat.\nTips\t",
    "title": "I:The Skull of the Horned King - DDO wiki",
    "tooltips": [
      "Flesh: Items made from flesh are often alive, or at least used to be. Disturbingly, this includes the Festivult Cookies...",
      "Platinum Piece",
      "Relentless Fury: While this item is equipped, any killing blows you strike against enemies may drive you into a furious rage, providing a 5% Enhancement damage bonus to your melee, ranged and unarmed attacks for 30 seconds. Slaying weaker opponents has a reduced chance of producing this effect.",
      " Armor-Piercing 25%: Passive: +25% Enhancement bonus to Fortification Bypass. (Fortification Bypass makes your attacks ignore a percentage of enemy Fortification.)",
      " Doublestrike 18%: Passive: 18% Enhancement bonus to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)",
      "Enhanced Bloodrage: This weapon is enhanced by blood - your blood! Each time you take damage or kill an enemy, there is a small chance that you will fall into an unholy bloodrage, greatly increasing your Melee Power, Constitution, and Damage. However, this rage will leave you more vulnerable to Physical attacks, slightly reducing your Armor Class.",
      "Nearly Complete: Ability Score: This item isn't quite finished, but it's only a step away from completion. Bring it to the forges on the upper floor of Gravenhollow and combine it with melted materials to restore this item to its full potential.",
      " Charisma +16: This item makes the wearer have more flair, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Charisma.",
      " Constitution +16: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Constitution.",
      " Dexterity +16: This item makes the wearer more nimble and dexterous, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Dexterity.",
      " Intelligence +16: This item focuses the power of the wearer's mind, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Intelligence.",
      " Strength +16: This item gives the wearer the power of Ogre Strength, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Strength.",
      " Wisdom +16: This item makes the wearer more in tune with her surroundings, granting a +16 Enhancement bonus to Wisdom.",
      "Blue, Green, Yellow, and/or Colorless",
      "Yellow and/or Colorless",
      "Sun",
      "Mythic Head Boost +1 or +3: +1 or +3 Mythic bonus to Physical and Magical Resistance Ratings.(This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.)"
    ],
    "requested": "Item:The_Skull_of_the_Horned_King"
  },
