    "text": "Legendary Goggles of the Archer\nMinimum level\t33\t\nItem Type\tJewelry / Goggles\nSlot\tEye\nRace Absolutely Required\tNone\nBinding\tBound to Account on Acquire\nDurability\t430\nMaterial\tSteel\nHardness\t53\nBase Value\t13,201pp \nWeight\t0.10 lbs\nLocation\tBook Burning, end chest\nEnchantments\t\nDoubleshot 9%\nSight Beyond Sight\nGreater Marksmanship\nInsightful Armor-Piercing 11%\nGreen Augment Slot\nColorless Augment Slot\nSun Augment Slot\nMythic Goggle Boost +1 or +3\n\t\nUpgradeable?\t\nDescription\tTBD\nTips\t\n\n\n",
    "title": "I:Legendary Goggles of the Archer - DDO wiki",
    "tooltips": [
      "Steel: Steel is the common metal used to make weapons and armor.",
      "Platinum Piece",
      " Doubleshot 9%: Passive: 9% Enhancement bonus to Doubleshot. (Doubleshot is a chance to score an additional hit with a ranged attack.)",
