    "text": "Legendary The Bloody Boulder\nMinimum level\t35\t\nItem Type\tJewelry / Trinket\nSlot\tTrinket\nRace Absolutely Required\tNone\nBinding\tBound to Account on Acquire\nDurability\t450\nMaterial\tLeather\nHardness\t55\nBase Value\t14,001pp \nWeight\t0.10 lbs\nLocation\tCatalyst Crafting, Turn in The Blood Stone, its Abyssal Catalyst and 5 Legendary Abyssal Gems at the Strange Catalyst Forge\nEnchantments\t\nQuality Seeker +3\nImproved Deception +22\nLegendary Accuracy +6\nLegendary Deadly +3\nGreen Augment Slot\nColorless Augment Slot\nSun Augment Slot\n\t\nUpgradeable?\t\nDescription\tA large and featureless blood red stone. Visions of murder and mayhem possess you the first time you pick up The Bloody Boulder.\nTips\t\n\n\n",
