    "text": "Legendary Piwafwi of the Drow Assassin\nMinimum level\t35\t\nItem Type\tClothing / Cloak\nSlot\tBack\nRace Absolutely Required\tNone\nBinding\tBound to Account on Acquire\nDurability\t450\nMaterial\tCloth\nHardness\t55\nBase Value\t14,001pp \nWeight\t0.10 lbs\nLocation\tCatalyst Crafting, Turn in Drow Piwafwi, its Legendary Deep Catalyst and 5 Legendary Abyssal Gems at the Strange Catalyst Forge\nEnchantments\t\nDeception +13\nLegendary Armor-Piercing 6%\nInsightful Assassinate +8\nQuality Assassinate +4\nGreen Augment Slot\nColorless Augment Slot\nSun Augment Slot\n\t\nUpgradeable?\t\nDescription\tFashioned from spider silk, these magical cloaks are prized possessions of their drow owners. This one was seemingly designed for stealth in mind, as it appears to bend light around the wearer, dampening any noise that they would otherwise produce.\nTips\t",
